  dependencies. Implementation follows TDD — tests first, per the project workflow.

  Coverage:
  - [1mEach factory[0m — [38;5;153mrequired[39m, [38;5;153mminLength[39m, [38;5;153mmaxLength[39m, [38;5;153memail[39m, [38;5;153mpattern[39m, [38;5;153mrange[39m: one passing case, one failing case, and the
    custom-message override.
  - [1mThe short-circuit rules[0m — empty + [38;5;153mrequired()[39m reports only "Required"; empty without [38;5;153mrequired()[39m passes the other
